# ADD-ON STAGE 7B: Lightning Strike on hit (Thunder Lance)

Thunder Lance is finished up to Stage 7. Do NOT change any existing layer, timing or gameplay unless this add-on says so. Do NOT run section 9 ("Finally") yet; I'll tell you when.

## What I want
When the spear HITS a player, a fierce, destructive lightning bolt strikes down from the sky onto that player a moment later. It should feel like overwhelming power: a big flash, ground damage and a heavy shake. It only happens on a character hit; walls, the floor and max range do NOT trigger it.

## Gameplay
- ⚖ STRIKE_DAMAGE = 0 for now (visual only). Don't change it unless I say so.
- The server triggers it. It sends Strike(targetId, groundPos, serverTime) to ALL clients right after the spear's Impact event. groundPos = a raycast straight down from the target's HumanoidRootPart (up to 20 studs); if nothing is found, use the target's position.
- If the target dies, leaves or resets in the meantime, still play the strike at the last known position.

