## Rules
- Screen flash: create a ColorCorrectionEffect LOCALLY on each client (never globally): Brightness +0.35 and Contrast +0.25 for 0.06 s, then back to 0 over 0.2 s. Add CONFIG.SCREEN_FLASH_ENABLED (default true) so I can turn it off. Don't touch the existing Lighting settings.
- Reuse the LightningBolt module and its pool. Extend it with "layers" (outer/middle/core widths) and "branches" options, without breaking the existing trail and spark bolts.
- New Blender assets only if needed: crater.png and crater_glow.png (512, white/grey, transparent background, same render rules as before).
- Budget for the strike alone: at most 120 particles, 90 Beams (3 layers × segments + branches), and 30 other instances. Report the real counts at the peak.
- Everything is cleaned up by 3.5 s. Repeat the Workspace descendant count test.

